{"id": "48111", "title": "蓝色生死恋", "author": "[韩]吴水娟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 26, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/48/48111/48111s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/48/48111.htm", "intro": "有一天，下课以后，恩熙骑着自行车回家，与一辆突然从胡同里出来的货车相撞，发生了很严重的交通事故。在被送到医院以后，她因为失血过多需要输血。但是她的父母在此时发现了一件很奇怪的事情，那就是恩熙的血型与尹教授夫妇的血型完全不一样。尹教授夫妇找到当初恩熙出生的医院，才了解到芯爱与恩熙被调换这一让人吃惊的事实。成长发育中的孩子在感情上都很敏感脆弱……", "base": "files/article/html/48/48111", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "1、蓝色怀想隧道就在那里", "file": "6516879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2、山坡旁的大海", "file": "6516880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3、铃铛声", "file": "6516881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4、那一片海", "file": "6516882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5、最美丽的问候", "file": "6516883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6、照进心里的阳光", "file": "6516884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7、噩梦", "file": "6516885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8、被禁止的爱情", "file": "6516886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9、幸福的告白", "file": "6516887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "10、兄妹", "file": "6516889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11、逐渐靠近", "file": "6516890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12、秘密", "file": "6516891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13、悲哀的幸福", "file": "6516892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14、恕你的罪", "file": "6516893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15、锁链", "file": "6516894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16、为了忘记你", "file": "6516895.html", "available": true}, {"title": "17、刑罚", "file": "6516896.html", "available": true}, {"title": "18、不要回来", "file": "6516897.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "19、放不开手", "file": "6516899.html", "available": true}, {"title": "20、离别的演习", "file": "6516900.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21、再见！我的爱", "file": "6516901.html", "available": true}, {"title": "22、无法说出口的爱的理由", "file": "6516902.html", "availab